isks / Notes\n\n- The strategy names \"model serving\" in this requirement but lists no serving component\n  in its Affected Components; this epic is mapped to the canonical Serving Runtimes\n  component and the owning team should be confirmed with the strategy author.\n- No architecture context file exists for the serving components; the serving-side\n  storage-dependency assumption could not be validated against architecture context.\n- The bundled-store endpoint is a configuration reference resolved at execution time;\n  this work proceeds in parallel with the Platform Operator enablement capability and\n  is gated by the acceptance criterion above rather than a hard ordering.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":43597,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b35faa3c50ce9d5b","agent_id":"a4eb990e8b7c5352b","session_id":"44316181-c1df-4de5-a431-6d099bdfeb64","uuid":"40e90b92-7d34-45ba-b3dd-0cf707d22ea2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:19:27.026Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9012"}
