itory with build metadata sufficient for later Konflux onboarding and\n50\t  image builds (Dockerfile/container build definition for the store image).\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- A midstream MinIO repository exists under opendatahub.io containing the cleared\n55\t  upstream sources at a pinned version.\n56\t- The repository follows the organization's midstream conventions (branching, license\n57\t  and provenance files, upstream-sync process documented).\n58\t- A container build definition for the store image builds locally from the repository.\n59\t\n60\t## HLR Traceability\n61\t\n62\t- HLR-2 (P0): Administrators can enable a supported, bundled S3-compatible object store\n63\t  through the Platform Operator, with productized images and upgrade lifecycle\n64\t  (productized-images portion, MinIO branch).\n65\t\n66\t## Risks / Notes\n67\t\n68\t- Conditional branch epic: executed only if the legal clearance outcome selects MinIO.\n69\t  If that outcome does not hold, this work is removed in favor of the Apache-2.0\n70\t  fallback chain.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ce0ddfef4d311b9","agent_id":"a3c3c25481f8c080e","session_id":"44316181-c1df-4de5-a431-6d099bdfeb64","uuid":"567740bf-87b0-4e6b-b87e-262516c815eb","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:26:03.498Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8c855136d6c3457","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9012 decomposition"}
